    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for wget.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 8.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "The wget packages provide the GNU Wget file retrieval utility for HTTP, HTTPS, and FTP protocols.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* wget: Misinterpretation of input may lead to improper behavior (CVE-2024-38428)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
      },
